If pluja valsi (lujvo form would be lujvla) becomes ''lujvo'', and cmalu valsi (lujvo form would be cmavla) becomes ''cmavo'', then why doesn't bridi valsi (lujvo form ''is'' brivla) become ''brivo''?

''Apparently the word was created after they got proper religion and no longer created lujvoid gismu.''

Maybe some real hardasses will stop using those terms and use the lujvla instead...


